<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

  <!--
    Bomb costs under Combat Extended, whose bombs are items with their real weight: 227 kg for a Mk. 82, 907 kg for a
    Mk. 84. Stock, they were made from about 33 kg and 70 kg of materials. Without CE the jet loads bombs from steel and
    none of this applies: everything sits inside one guard on something only the Harrier's CE patch sets (the Mk. 82's
    227 kg).

    The case is a bomb case of our own (0.6.0, owner's choice, 7 Nov 2026), one per bomb: the Mk. 82 case and the Mk. 84
    case, each made from steel at the machining table, and at Dead Man's Switch - Expedition's rotary forger when that
    exists. It replaced RimThunder's heavy casting, which doesn't stack: each casting took a whole slot of a VFE Factory
    hopper, so the automated machining bays clogged on them. The cases stack to 4 (agent default), and VFE Factory gives
    the machining bay a bill for each of them by itself, because they are made at the machining table.

    Case weights are the real ones (secondary sources in docs/development/vehicle-patches.md): 140 kg and 478 kg, so 280
    and 956 steel at 0.5 kg a unit. Work 1,000 and 3,000, what the 2 and 6 castings took before. Skill as the bombs that
    use them. No research of their own: the bombs keep theirs. Everything else is AUTHORED.

    Real fill weights are sourced: 87 kg and 429 kg. The Mk. 82 and the incendiary fall short of their weight on purpose
    (owner's choice, 2 Nov 2026): matching it took 174 FSX or 858 prometheum, far too much play time to make, so chemfuel
    carries most of the fill. They share one ratio per kg of real fill: about 0.23 of the scarce ingredient and 3.5
    chemfuel. The EMP, smoke and tox fills have no real equivalent to source.

    MarketValue is removed from the bombs and never set on the cases, so the game works it out from the ingredients, its
    normal rule for made items (StatWorker_MarketValue). Change a number here to rescale a bomb.
  -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="FWA_Bomb500lb"]/statBases[Mass="227"]</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>

        <!-- The two bomb cases. Added as Defs here so they exist only under CE, where the bombs use them. -->
        <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
          <xpath>Defs</xpath>
          <value>
            <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
              <defName>PhobosBombCaseMk82</defName>
              <label>Mk. 82 bomb case</label>
              <description>The empty steel body of a 500 lb Mk. 82 bomb: forged and machined, with no filling, fuze or fins yet. Filling and finishing it makes the bomb. Several stack together.</description>
              <graphicData>
                <texPath>Phobos/VehiclePatches/BombCaseMk82</texPath>
                <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
              </graphicData>
              <stackLimit>4</stackLimit>
              <smeltable>true</smeltable>
              <statBases>
                <MaxHitPoints>150</MaxHitPoints>
                <Mass>140</Mass>
                <Bulk>20</Bulk>
                <Flammability>0</Flammability>
                <WorkToMake>1000</WorkToMake>
              </statBases>
              <thingCategories>
                <li>Manufactured</li>
              </thingCategories>
              <costList>
                <Steel>280</Steel>
              </costList>
              <recipeMaker>
                <workSpeedStat>GeneralLaborSpeed</workSpeedStat>
                <workSkill>Crafting</workSkill>
                <effectWorking>Smith</effectWorking>
                <soundWorking>Recipe_Machining</soundWorking>
                <recipeUsers>
                  <li>TableMachining</li>
                </recipeUsers>
                <skillRequirements>
                  <Crafting>6</Crafting>
                </skillRequirements>
              </recipeMaker>
            </ThingDef>
            <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
              <defName>PhobosBombCaseMk84</defName>
              <label>Mk. 84 bomb case</label>
              <description>The empty steel body of a 2,000 lb Mk. 84 bomb: forged and machined, with no filling, fuze or fins yet. Filling and finishing it makes the bomb. Several stack together.</description>
              <graphicData>
                <texPath>Phobos/VehiclePatches/BombCaseMk84</texPath>
                <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
              </graphicData>
              <stackLimit>4</stackLimit>
              <smeltable>true</smeltable>
              <statBases>
                <MaxHitPoints>300</MaxHitPoints>
                <Mass>478</Mass>
                <Bulk>40</Bulk>
                <Flammability>0</Flammability>
                <WorkToMake>3000</WorkToMake>
              </statBases>
              <thingCategories>
                <li>Manufactured</li>
              </thingCategories>
              <costList>
                <Steel>956</Steel>
              </costList>
              <recipeMaker>
                <workSpeedStat>GeneralLaborSpeed</workSpeedStat>
                <workSkill>Crafting</workSkill>
                <effectWorking>Smith</effectWorking>
                <soundWorking>Recipe_Machining</soundWorking>
                <recipeUsers>
                  <li>TableMachining</li>
                </recipeUsers>
                <skillRequirements>
                  <Crafting>7</Crafting>
                </skillRequirements>
              </recipeMaker>
            </ThingDef>
          </value>
        </li>

        <!--
          Both cases at the rotary forger too, while Dead Man's Switch - Expedition provides it. The forger runs ordinary
          recipes (Fortified.Building_WorkTableAutonomous, read 3 and 6 Nov 2026), so naming it is all it takes. The
          RecipeDefs are generated after patches, from these recipeUsers. A sequence step that fails ends the sequence,
          hence success Always.
        -->
        <li Class="PatchOperationConditional">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="DMSE_TableLathe"]</xpath>
          <match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
            <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="PhobosBombCaseMk82" or defName="PhobosBombCaseMk84"]/recipeMaker/recipeUsers</xpath>
            <value>
              <li>DMSE_TableLathe</li>
            </value>
          </match>
        </li>

        <!-- Mk. 82, 227 kg: a 140 kg case, 10 kg FSX, 15 kg chemfuel and two components, 166 kg in all. -->
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="FWA_Bomb500lb"]/costList</xpath>
          <value>
            <costList>
              <PhobosBombCaseMk82>1</PhobosBombCaseMk82>
              <FSX>20</FSX>
              <Chemfuel>300</Chemfuel>
              <ComponentIndustrial>2</ComponentIndustrial>
            </costList>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationRemove">
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="FWA_Bomb500lb"]/statBases/MarketValue</xpath>
        </li>

        <!-- Mk. 84 incendiary, 907 kg: 604 kg of materials, short on purpose (see the header). -->
        <li Class="PatchOperationConditional">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Harrier_Mk84Bomb_Incendiary"]</xpath>
          <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
            <operations>
              <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
                <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Harrier_Mk84Bomb_Incendiary"]/costList</xpath>
                <value>
                  <costList>
                    <PhobosBombCaseMk84>1</PhobosBombCaseMk84>
                    <Prometheum>100</Prometheum>
                    <Chemfuel>1500</Chemfuel>
                    <ComponentIndustrial>2</ComponentIndustrial>
                  </costList>
                </value>
              </li>
              <li Class="PatchOperationRemove">
                <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Harrier_Mk84Bomb_Incendiary"]/statBases/MarketValue</xpath>
              </li>
            </operations>
          </match>
        </li>

        <!-- Mk. 84 EMP, 907 kg. The steel stands for the coils and ballast of the device. -->
        <li Class="PatchOperationConditional">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Harrier_Mk84Bomb_EMP"]</xpath>
          <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
            <operations>
              <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
                <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Harrier_Mk84Bomb_EMP"]/costList</xpath>
                <value>
                  <costList>
                    <PhobosBombCaseMk84>1</PhobosBombCaseMk84>
                    <Steel>840</Steel>
                    <ComponentIndustrial>12</ComponentIndustrial>
                  </costList>
                </value>
              </li>
              <li Class="PatchOperationRemove">
                <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Harrier_Mk84Bomb_EMP"]/statBases/MarketValue</xpath>
              </li>
            </operations>
          </match>
        </li>

        <!-- Mk. 84 smoke, 907 kg. The steel stands for the smoke canisters inside. -->
        <li Class="PatchOperationConditional">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Harrier_Mk84Bomb_Smoke"]</xpath>
          <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
            <operations>
              <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
                <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Harrier_Mk84Bomb_Smoke"]/costList</xpath>
                <value>
                  <costList>
                    <PhobosBombCaseMk84>1</PhobosBombCaseMk84>
                    <Steel>760</Steel>
                    <Chemfuel>1000</Chemfuel>
                    <ComponentIndustrial>1</ComponentIndustrial>
                  </costList>
                </value>
              </li>
              <li Class="PatchOperationRemove">
                <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Harrier_Mk84Bomb_Smoke"]/statBases/MarketValue</xpath>
              </li>
            </operations>
          </match>
        </li>

        <!-- Mk. 84 poison gas, 907 kg. Exists only with Biotech. -->
        <li Class="PatchOperationConditional">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Harrier_Mk84Bomb_ToxGas"]</xpath>
          <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
            <operations>
              <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
                <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Harrier_Mk84Bomb_ToxGas"]/costList</xpath>
                <value>
                  <costList>
                    <PhobosBombCaseMk84>1</PhobosBombCaseMk84>
                    <Wastepack>72</Wastepack>
                    <ComponentIndustrial>1</ComponentIndustrial>
                  </costList>
                </value>
              </li>
              <li Class="PatchOperationRemove">
                <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Harrier_Mk84Bomb_ToxGas"]/statBases/MarketValue</xpath>
              </li>
            </operations>
          </match>
        </li>

      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
